<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Banco Mello Q1 cons net higher.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Banco Mello Q1 cons net higher.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to March 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Cons net  0.54 vs 0.07</p>
<p>Financial margin 7.3 vs 6.6</p>
<p>Operating cash flow 5.0 vs 3.3</p>
<p>Cash flow 4.7 vs 2.8</p>
<p>Net provisions 2.6 vs 1.4</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Banco Mello SA.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
